# Original iPhone photos.
# Browsers cannot display HEIC — the web-ready WebP/JPEG conversions in
# images/ are what the site actually serves. Keeping the ~25 MB of originals
# out of the repo keeps clones fast and avoids publishing unused files.
# Keep them backed up somewhere; they're the source for re-exporting photos.
*.heic
*.HEIC

